specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:10:1. **Backend framework**: Express vs Fastify
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:17:### 1. Backend Framework: Express
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:19:**Decision**: Use **Express.js**
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:22:- **Maturity**: Express is the de facto standard for Node.js web frameworks with extensive ecosystem
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:23:- **Simplicity**: For this MVP, we need only 4-5 REST endpoints (CRUD for projects). Express provides exactly what we need without ceremony
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:26:- **Performance**: For persistence-only API with low concurrency (single-user educational tool), Express performance is more than sufficient
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:33:- Use Express 4.x with TypeScript
specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md:1649:| Backend framework | Express | Simple, mature, sufficient for 5 endpoints |
